    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for libmaxminddb.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 8.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "The libmaxminddb package contains the MaxMind DB library.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libmaxminddb: improper initialization in dump_entry_data_list() in maxminddb.c (CVE-2020-28241)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
